WEBVTT

00:06.047 --> 00:08.341
THIS EPISODE CONTAINS
GRAPHIC DEPICTIONS OF SCHOOL VIOLENCE

00:08.425 --> 00:09.926
WHICH SOME VIEWERS MAY FIND DISTURBING

00:15.015 --> 00:18.893
Would… people become scared
once they lose trust,

00:18.977 --> 00:23.064
or do they lose trust
once they become scared?

00:23.148 --> 00:25.025
Whatever the reason is,

00:25.108 --> 00:26.609
I'd love to see things change.

00:27.944 --> 00:30.989
Do you really think a plan like that
would work in Korea?

00:32.115 --> 00:35.952
Korea's not some sprinkling
of backwater villages anymore.

00:36.953 --> 00:38.580
It's on a whole different level.

00:40.290 --> 00:41.291
Level?

00:42.292 --> 00:44.169
Do you know how Korea is right now?

00:44.669 --> 00:48.548
You can get drugs anywhere, anytime,
if you want to.

00:48.631 --> 00:50.467
It used to be a drug-free country.

00:52.510 --> 00:55.764
And half of the nation
already knows how to use a gun.

00:56.264 --> 00:58.349
It'd be the easiest country ever.

00:58.975 --> 01:00.268
The easiest?

01:00.351 --> 01:01.728
Of course.

01:02.729 --> 01:04.731
Korea is in a mental war now.

01:05.732 --> 01:08.526
The society is rife with conflicts,

01:08.610 --> 01:11.237
and someone just needs
to pull the trigger for them.

01:25.043 --> 01:25.960
Wait here.

01:31.841 --> 01:33.259
You wanted to see me, sir?

01:33.343 --> 01:35.136
I did. Take a seat.

01:42.393 --> 01:43.228
Jeong-man…

01:47.440 --> 01:50.360
Jeong-man, you backstabbing bitch!

01:51.611 --> 01:52.779
You using guns?

01:53.905 --> 01:54.739
No.

01:55.323 --> 01:56.199
You sure?

01:56.282 --> 01:59.911
I have no idea what the hell's going on.
Why guns all of a sudden?

02:01.121 --> 02:03.373
Ah! You're confused, huh?

02:03.456 --> 02:04.541
So was I.

02:05.458 --> 02:08.586
A cop I know suddenly came to see me
and asked if I had guns,

02:08.670 --> 02:11.381
and I didn't have a fucking clue
what he was going on about.

02:11.464 --> 02:14.467
Why would a cop you know
come here out of the blue?

02:14.551 --> 02:17.387
I asked myself the same thing,
and then he dragged this out.

02:23.601 --> 02:25.728
I… Who is this guy?

02:25.812 --> 02:27.355
You tell me.

02:28.898 --> 02:31.901
Didn't you ask me the other day
if I knew the names of your men?

02:32.986 --> 02:36.489
Well, I don't know a single one of them,
so I figured I should ask you.

02:37.115 --> 02:38.950
No, no, he's not one of my men.

02:40.410 --> 02:42.495
Be honest with me
or there will be hell to pay.

02:44.289 --> 02:47.041
I wouldn't lie about this, I swear.
I don't know this person.

02:52.172 --> 02:53.673
So you're telling the truth?

02:55.383 --> 02:56.301
Yeah.

02:58.970 --> 03:02.807
Okay! Huh! I got scared for no reason.

03:03.391 --> 03:05.226
That cop can be very convincing.

03:05.310 --> 03:06.644
All right.

03:06.728 --> 03:08.354
You can go now.

03:29.834 --> 03:31.127
He's onto us.

03:31.211 --> 03:33.796
Find the guns, as quickly as you can.

03:33.880 --> 03:36.633
Seok-ho, what did that bastard say?

03:36.716 --> 03:38.343
He said he doesn't know the guy.

03:38.426 --> 03:39.594
He said that?

03:40.553 --> 03:43.473
Wow, I can't believe
he lied right to your face.

04:02.533 --> 04:05.245
- Ah, man! Too bad!
- The floor is so slippery again.

04:05.328 --> 04:08.248
- Poor Fuck-Gyu.
- Why not find a place to clean up?

04:09.249 --> 04:10.458
Hey, creep.

04:11.918 --> 04:13.836
Say goodbye to your pretty life soon.

04:16.005 --> 04:17.006
You hear?

04:23.054 --> 04:24.639
Don't even think about it.

04:27.600 --> 04:30.061
Hey! Hey! Stop it!

04:31.646 --> 04:32.689
What's going on?

04:33.189 --> 04:36.359
Well, sir, uh,
the floor was just so slippery…

04:36.442 --> 04:38.945
You should be more careful.
Look at the mess you made.

04:39.445 --> 04:40.446
You okay?

04:41.823 --> 04:43.449
Do I look okay to you?

04:43.533 --> 04:46.703
What's with the attitude?
I'm asking because I'm concerned.

04:47.578 --> 04:49.038
Let him walk it off.

04:49.122 --> 04:50.123
And you!

04:53.251 --> 04:54.961
Hey! Park Gyu-jin!

04:55.586 --> 04:58.673
Stop right there!
What do you think you're doing?

04:58.756 --> 05:00.216
Hey, Kim Bae, wait for me!

05:00.300 --> 05:02.635
There's the loser kid who never runs.

05:02.719 --> 05:04.554
Come on, you're embarrassing me.

05:19.861 --> 05:23.489
The more lists we find,
the more complicated it gets.

05:24.699 --> 05:25.533
Lee.

05:26.034 --> 05:27.035
Look at this.

05:28.870 --> 05:30.955
These ones have the same number of rows.

05:31.039 --> 05:33.541
That means
there are as many guns as addresses.

05:34.125 --> 05:36.085
How many lists have we acquired so far?

05:36.169 --> 05:37.587
Over 20 pages.

05:39.589 --> 05:43.718
That means they sent out
hundreds of firearms across the country.

05:58.358 --> 06:02.362
HAVE YOU HAD A CHANCE
TO LOOK FOR THAT ADDRESS LIST?

06:16.042 --> 06:17.418
OF COURSE

06:24.217 --> 06:26.010
TAKE CARE
LET ME KNOW WHEN YOU FIND IT

06:31.182 --> 06:33.851
OKAY. CALL ME
IF YOU NEED MOON BAEK'S HELP! I'M BORED

06:45.405 --> 06:49.367
That officer who's been snooping around
for the last few days,

06:49.992 --> 06:51.536
do you want us to take care of him?

06:52.161 --> 06:53.371
Leave him alone.

06:53.955 --> 06:56.958
- There are many pawns in this game.
- Yes, boss.

06:57.458 --> 06:59.752
I think… it's about time we get going.

07:03.131 --> 07:04.215
Okay.

07:04.841 --> 07:07.635
It's time now
to put some of those pawns into play.

07:27.530 --> 07:28.656
It's all ready, sir.

07:55.933 --> 07:59.353
Hey, I heard you stood up to Seong-jun.

07:59.854 --> 08:01.522
And threw a chair at him too.

08:01.606 --> 08:02.607
So what?

08:04.525 --> 08:05.735
Weren't you scared?

08:06.235 --> 08:08.488
He'll be more cruel to you now.

08:09.155 --> 08:11.574
He bullies you
because you don't stick up for yourself.

08:12.492 --> 08:13.993
You're stronger than me.

08:17.205 --> 08:18.748
You pack quite a punch, man.

08:20.791 --> 08:21.709
Oh.

08:22.251 --> 08:24.462
- Sorry about that. I…
- It's okay.

08:25.588 --> 08:27.590
I understand you better than anyone.

08:28.716 --> 08:29.800
Thanks, Gyu-jin.

08:30.343 --> 08:32.345
What I'm saying is,

08:32.428 --> 08:34.388
if you feel frustrated or annoyed,

08:34.472 --> 08:36.307
just don't stand there and take it.

08:36.891 --> 08:38.768
Do whatever you can to fight back.

08:38.851 --> 08:40.394
Do you think I could do it?

08:40.478 --> 08:42.939
Get off of me, you bastard!

08:47.235 --> 08:49.487
Fuck you! Leave me alone!

08:50.154 --> 08:53.741
- This'll be fun. Get a close-up.
- Whoa, why's everyone fighting?

08:59.539 --> 09:02.208
- Outta my way, outta my way!
- Move it. Now!

09:04.418 --> 09:06.379
What the fuck?

09:06.963 --> 09:08.297
Someone help me!

09:14.095 --> 09:15.513
Get up, you asshole!

09:16.222 --> 09:18.849
SHOOTING CAFÉ

09:18.933 --> 09:21.143
- This okay?
- Whoa, no way!

09:46.419 --> 09:48.713
DO NOT FIRE AT PEOPLE

09:54.510 --> 09:55.803
A gun, a gun, a gun!

09:56.721 --> 09:57.555
Get away!

10:04.770 --> 10:05.855
Ah!

10:08.232 --> 10:09.525
Oh-oh!

10:14.905 --> 10:16.532
Are those BB pellets?

10:16.616 --> 10:17.658
It's a BB gun!

10:18.159 --> 10:21.412
Looked like a real gun.

10:26.542 --> 10:27.793
Huh?

10:29.754 --> 10:30.963
Who's shooting at us?!

10:33.215 --> 10:34.425
Ah!

10:40.598 --> 10:42.016
Ah!

10:47.980 --> 10:49.690
- Ah!
- Ah!

11:01.327 --> 11:03.829
- It's time you thugs learned your lesson.
- He's so…

11:03.913 --> 11:05.331
What do you think about that?!

11:06.499 --> 11:09.210
Hey! Who the fuck
do you think you are? Huh?

11:09.293 --> 11:10.711
- Me?
- Oh shit!

11:13.714 --> 11:15.508
Moon Baek.

11:20.262 --> 11:21.430
Ah!

11:48.165 --> 11:49.166
Wow.

12:03.347 --> 12:04.682
Excuse me, sir.

12:08.936 --> 12:09.770
Could you…

12:11.272 --> 12:13.357
What you just did, can you teach me how?

12:14.400 --> 12:16.026
Hold my breath in,

12:16.777 --> 12:18.821
and once my body is no longer shaking,

12:19.447 --> 12:20.865
gently pull the trigger.

12:26.954 --> 12:27.788
Shoot.

12:28.706 --> 12:31.542
Wow.

12:33.210 --> 12:34.044
Yo!

12:34.670 --> 12:36.714
This gives me so much confidence,
you have no clue.

13:08.037 --> 13:09.580
Here. Take it.

13:10.915 --> 13:12.166
You wanna try shooting?

13:14.210 --> 13:15.127
I don't…

13:16.045 --> 13:17.004
Hmm?

13:19.256 --> 13:21.008
Hey, I'm home.

13:21.509 --> 13:23.969
- Oh, Gyu-jin, you're home.
- Yeah, I'll be in my room.

13:35.231 --> 13:36.315
Gyu-jin.

13:36.899 --> 13:38.234
I brought you some fruit.

13:40.736 --> 13:42.154
Just leave it on the desk.

13:48.744 --> 13:50.496
Are you feeling sick? Hmm?

13:52.957 --> 13:54.667
Maybe you have a fever.

13:55.292 --> 13:57.837
Mom, I'm grown up now.
I don't need to be coddled.

13:58.671 --> 14:01.757
I know. You're all grown-up now.

14:01.841 --> 14:03.384
All without my help.

14:08.347 --> 14:10.182
Don't say without your help.

14:11.517 --> 14:13.185
I know you're doing the best you can.

14:14.645 --> 14:17.231
Thank you for being kind.

14:19.525 --> 14:20.901
Can I ask you something?

14:21.735 --> 14:22.570
Yeah?

14:23.237 --> 14:25.072
When are people the most upset?

14:25.573 --> 14:27.700
Hmm. I'm the most upset

14:27.783 --> 14:29.618
when you're not feeling well.

14:31.871 --> 14:33.706
Or when you're having a hard time.

14:34.582 --> 14:36.792
I suppose all parents feel the same way.

14:36.876 --> 14:39.837
There's nothing more important
than their children's well-being.

14:40.337 --> 14:43.340
Jeong-man is collecting
all the addresses on his list.

14:43.924 --> 14:45.134
And Mr. Kim?

14:46.051 --> 14:48.971
Well, it seems like no one has found
the storage room yet.

14:49.805 --> 14:52.224
Damn. Do I have to hold their hands?

14:53.559 --> 14:55.144
No, that's not it.

14:55.227 --> 14:56.103
INCORRECT PATTERN

14:56.729 --> 14:58.230
Not that one either.

14:59.607 --> 15:01.025
Ah, shit!

15:01.525 --> 15:04.445
Hey! Next time,
bring me a phone with a password.

15:05.195 --> 15:06.030
Sorry, sir.

15:06.113 --> 15:09.074
Sorry won't cut it this time…
you incompetent ass--

15:10.701 --> 15:11.911
Oh.

15:11.994 --> 15:14.663
NO CALLER ID

15:17.541 --> 15:18.584
Hello?

15:19.209 --> 15:20.419
Hello?

15:21.170 --> 15:22.212
H… hello?

15:22.880 --> 15:23.839
Who the hell is this?

15:24.423 --> 15:26.091
Why are you calling this phone?

15:26.759 --> 15:28.135
Everything okay, sir?

15:29.637 --> 15:32.389
How did you… get this number?

15:32.973 --> 15:34.183
Yeah, it's mine.

15:34.266 --> 15:36.852
All right, cowboy. The fuck do you want?

15:36.936 --> 15:39.021
Yes, yes, I'm going!

15:39.104 --> 15:41.815
Boxes? What boxes?

15:42.441 --> 15:43.359
"Red sticker"?

15:43.442 --> 15:45.569
Hey! Look for boxes with a red sticker.

15:45.653 --> 15:48.572
But, sir, all the boxes in here
have red stickers.

15:49.448 --> 15:50.699
What the…?

15:52.076 --> 15:53.953
So many red stickers.

15:56.372 --> 16:00.542
Okay. Mr. Kim,
what the hell are you hiding in here?

16:01.377 --> 16:02.878
What the fuck?

16:04.922 --> 16:05.923
What the hell's this?

16:06.590 --> 16:08.842
You found them? The guns?

16:09.969 --> 16:12.221
Are… are these real guns?

16:12.805 --> 16:15.265
If you're curious,
start by shooting yourself in the head.

16:15.349 --> 16:18.811
Hey, no, no!
Hey, hey, hey, uh, I… I trust you.

16:18.894 --> 16:20.938
The shootings in the news lately,

16:21.021 --> 16:22.731
all the guns came from that room.

16:22.815 --> 16:24.274
Oh, my God!

16:24.358 --> 16:25.484
Listen to me.

16:25.567 --> 16:29.363
Thanks to you offing Mr. Kim,
all the guns are piled up in there.

16:29.446 --> 16:31.448
With no Mr. Kim,

16:32.199 --> 16:34.535
I'm put in a very difficult position.

16:36.453 --> 16:37.830
But, luckily enough,

16:39.289 --> 16:41.792
I have different buyers
for all those guns.

16:41.875 --> 16:44.586
Who… who… who's looking for these?

16:45.129 --> 16:46.130
Gu Jeong-man?

16:46.213 --> 16:47.297
Jeong-man?

16:47.840 --> 16:49.174
How do you know his name?

16:50.926 --> 16:53.887
I'm not sure totally sure
what Jeong-man is planning,

16:53.971 --> 16:56.432
but you should rethink
your strategy very carefully.

16:57.808 --> 16:59.393
You're a main player now,

17:00.144 --> 17:01.979
especially with all those guns.

17:03.981 --> 17:05.107
H… hello?

17:06.900 --> 17:08.027
Fuck me.

17:31.508 --> 17:33.052
- Go.
- No, no.

17:33.135 --> 17:34.136
Hey, I gotta go.

17:34.219 --> 17:36.096
You better go. Your wife's waiting.

17:36.180 --> 17:37.806
I'll see you later. Bye-bye!

17:37.890 --> 17:39.767
Yes, we have enough gathered here.

17:42.102 --> 17:43.353
We'll get on it right away.

17:51.862 --> 17:53.989
Excuse me! Excuse me, sirs!

17:54.782 --> 17:55.657
Hello!

17:56.158 --> 17:59.703
It's important that you guys remember
one very important thing, okay?

17:59.787 --> 18:03.290
Take a picture after the package
is delivered. Sounds good?

18:03.373 --> 18:07.169
You need… to take the picture
and send it to us,

18:07.252 --> 18:09.254
so we can deposit your money.

18:09.338 --> 18:10.714
Understood?

18:10.798 --> 18:12.174
Okay, let's go.

18:12.257 --> 18:15.427
They all have to go, so come on.

18:18.097 --> 18:19.890
- No rush!
- Don't forget the picture!

18:19.973 --> 18:21.058
Yes! Yes, good.

18:21.141 --> 18:23.018
Ah, you take these.

18:26.105 --> 18:27.606
The packages are on their way.

18:28.607 --> 18:29.483
Okay.

18:30.901 --> 18:34.404
It's nice how many different ways
you can get something delivered in Korea.

18:42.037 --> 18:45.457
Come home early tonight.
I'll buy your favorite meat for dinner.

18:57.970 --> 19:00.222
I thought you said
you were too old for hugs.

19:00.305 --> 19:03.183
You changed your tune
when I said "meat for dinner."

19:03.976 --> 19:06.395
- See you later.
- All right, darling.

19:13.861 --> 19:15.904
We have an update, sir.

19:15.988 --> 19:18.532
The student is on his way
to school with a gun.

19:20.450 --> 19:22.536
When you were adopted, how old were you?

19:23.871 --> 19:25.080
Nine years old, sir.

19:25.164 --> 19:27.166
And did you find your parents?

19:28.667 --> 19:29.501
Yes.

19:30.294 --> 19:31.420
And were they cool?

19:31.503 --> 19:33.422
I could only see them from afar.

19:37.176 --> 19:38.093
Why's that?

19:38.177 --> 19:41.555
I thought I'd feel miserable
if they didn't remember who I was.

19:45.350 --> 19:46.351
Yeah.

19:49.938 --> 19:51.440
Then we…

19:52.691 --> 19:54.568
…should make sure they don't forget.

20:03.577 --> 20:05.245
Line Three, 30% of photos received.

20:05.329 --> 20:07.831
Line Two, 30% of photos received so far.

20:07.915 --> 20:09.958
Line seven, 50% of photos received.

20:10.042 --> 20:12.169
Line Four, 70% of photos received.

20:12.252 --> 20:15.547
Departure of all couriers
on Line Five and Line Seven confirmed.

20:15.631 --> 20:17.424
30% of photos received from Dongin.

20:17.507 --> 20:19.426
60% of photos received from Gyeongseo.

20:19.509 --> 20:21.803
80% of photos received from Gyeongseo.

20:21.887 --> 20:24.681
The packages containing guns
are being distributed as planned.

20:24.765 --> 20:26.350
We'll keep you posted with updates.

20:26.433 --> 20:27.434
Okay.

20:38.320 --> 20:41.114
Come on, cheer up!
Aren't you happy to see me? Huh?

20:43.158 --> 20:44.243
Is Mrs. Oh okay?

20:45.911 --> 20:47.412
Yes. Thank you for that.

20:48.705 --> 20:51.166
Do you have that list of addresses?

20:52.876 --> 20:53.794
Take it.

20:55.963 --> 20:57.756
I don't usually trust people,

20:57.839 --> 21:00.592
although I feel like I can trust you
for some reason, Officer Lee.

21:03.512 --> 21:07.182
But… …there's something
bugging me a little,

21:08.141 --> 21:08.976
right there.

21:10.519 --> 21:12.688
There's a high school kid on that list.

21:15.857 --> 21:16.984
Shouldn't we go check?

21:21.029 --> 21:23.824
- Keep watch until Fat-Ass shows up.
- Yeah, o… okay.

21:30.414 --> 21:32.833
Did that asshole
go die in a ditch somewhere?

21:33.750 --> 21:34.584
Hey.

21:35.752 --> 21:36.920
Let me bum that.

21:37.004 --> 21:39.381
- This guy never has his own smokes.
- So?

21:39.464 --> 21:41.842
Damn it, man, why can't you
just buy your own for a change?

21:44.511 --> 21:45.345
What's up?

21:46.179 --> 21:47.264
You still pissed off?

21:47.347 --> 21:48.682
I hate that dumbass.

21:49.349 --> 21:50.392
I can't do anything to him

21:50.475 --> 21:52.644
'cause the homeroom teacher's
always watching.

21:52.728 --> 21:55.689
Hey, you should just lie low.
You don't wanna get kicked out.

21:56.273 --> 21:58.900
It's just fucking embarrassing is all.

21:58.984 --> 22:01.486
Hey, who locked the doors? What the hell?

22:03.071 --> 22:05.115
Yo, teacher! I need to go to the bathroom!

22:05.198 --> 22:08.201
- Hey, man! Try pulling it.
- I don't wanna piss my pants!

22:08.285 --> 22:10.871
- What's happening?
- Someone locked this.

22:10.954 --> 22:12.164
What is this?

22:12.873 --> 22:16.418
- It was locked from outside.
- Who did this? This isn't funny.

22:17.252 --> 22:19.254
- This is illegal.
- Break it down.

22:19.755 --> 22:21.298
Open it now.

22:29.848 --> 22:30.932
Hey, Gyu-jin.

22:32.434 --> 22:33.894
Yes, Prefect? What is it?

22:33.977 --> 22:36.855
Homeroom teacher wants to see you.
On the double.

22:43.362 --> 22:45.739
Ah, I really wanna fuck over
that Gyu-jin kid.

22:45.822 --> 22:47.491
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

22:48.825 --> 22:49.951
What about that?

22:50.911 --> 22:53.914
- Oh! That's nasty! Do it!
- So gross.

22:53.997 --> 22:54.831
Hey.

22:55.582 --> 22:56.958
Go get Fuck-Gyu's backpack.

22:58.668 --> 23:00.128
Yes, sir!

23:08.220 --> 23:09.262
Hello?

23:09.346 --> 23:11.515
What took you so long to pick up?
Where are you?

23:11.598 --> 23:12.808
What's going on, Do?

23:12.891 --> 23:14.935
Head over to Jeongil High School
right away.

23:15.018 --> 23:18.230
There's a student from that school
who's on the list, and he has a gun.

23:19.147 --> 23:20.148
I'll meet you there.

23:24.569 --> 23:27.030
Hey, turn around.
Head for Jeongil High School.

23:30.659 --> 23:33.120
It's Officer Lee Do
from the Domyeong Precinct.

23:33.203 --> 23:36.289
We met before at a training seminar
on school violence?

23:36.790 --> 23:40.043
Yes, hello, Officer Lee.
Is there something you need help with?

23:40.127 --> 23:42.796
I'm calling because there's
a possibility of a student in your school

23:42.879 --> 23:44.673
that may be part of a case
I'm investigating.

23:44.756 --> 23:47.759
One of our students? Do you have a name?

23:47.843 --> 23:49.177
I'm not sure what his name is,

23:49.261 --> 23:50.887
but I have a number.

23:51.638 --> 23:53.765
Okay, go ahead and give me the number.

23:53.849 --> 23:57.018
It's 010-337-8155.

23:57.102 --> 23:58.228
You wanted to see me?

23:58.311 --> 24:00.188
One second. Yes, I understand.

24:00.272 --> 24:02.691
Let me take a look
and call you back as soon as I can.

24:03.817 --> 24:05.444
Gyu-jin.

24:06.403 --> 24:07.320
I wanted to talk,

24:07.404 --> 24:09.948
but something urgent just came up
that I can't ignore.

24:10.031 --> 24:10.991
Can you come back later?

24:11.074 --> 24:12.033
Yeah.

24:12.117 --> 24:13.243
I apologize.

24:13.743 --> 24:15.912
Hey, guys, how's it looking down there?

24:15.996 --> 24:18.206
- All the doors are locked.
- Everything is barricaded.

24:18.290 --> 24:21.001
There'll be serious consequences
for whoever did this.

24:21.084 --> 24:24.171
Sir, the cafeteria
and the western entrance are all locked!

24:24.254 --> 24:26.923
Can someone ask the janitor
to find a bolt cutter as soon as possible?

24:28.133 --> 24:29.468
You fucking bitch!

24:30.635 --> 24:34.055
Such an asshole!
You answer when I fucking call you!

24:34.139 --> 24:37.225
You motherfucking bitch!
Try not to suck so much!

24:37.309 --> 24:39.186
- Where the hell was our lunch, huh?
- Answer him!

24:41.980 --> 24:43.732
Take it! There! Take it!

24:44.858 --> 24:47.444
- Motherfucking pussy!
- You fucking dick.

24:48.195 --> 24:50.572
Hey, where were you?
Why so fucking late, huh?

24:50.655 --> 24:52.491
Fuck you, little shit!

24:52.991 --> 24:54.409
Shut your mouth!

24:55.535 --> 24:56.745
STUDENT RECORDS

25:00.999 --> 25:03.376
FIND: 8155

25:04.377 --> 25:05.337
NO RESULTS FOUND

25:14.554 --> 25:16.056
Hey, Fuck-gyu!

25:18.975 --> 25:21.311
This? You recognize it?

25:21.394 --> 25:23.813
You piece of shit.

25:23.897 --> 25:26.191
What were you gonna do with this?
Shoot us?

25:26.274 --> 25:29.361
I was wondering
why you were acting so tough lately.

25:31.112 --> 25:34.449
- It was because of this toy?
- It does look kinda scary.

25:34.533 --> 25:36.117
Scary? Come on, you kidding?

25:36.618 --> 25:38.870
Hey, does this scare you?

25:38.954 --> 25:39.996
No. Shoot.

25:40.997 --> 25:42.499
You're scared of this prop?

25:42.582 --> 25:44.000
- Are you scared?
- Huh?

25:44.668 --> 25:46.378
It's just a BB gun.

25:46.461 --> 25:48.380
Who do you think you're fooling?

25:49.047 --> 25:51.508
Don't shoot. Don't shoot, please…

25:51.591 --> 25:52.717
Really?

25:52.801 --> 25:54.386
Huh?

25:56.638 --> 25:58.890
You're not going anywhere, you asshole.

26:00.350 --> 26:02.018
This phone is turned off.

26:02.102 --> 26:04.396
Your call will be directed to voicemail
after the beep.

26:04.479 --> 26:05.939
He can't be reached.

26:06.898 --> 26:09.276
Kids are required to turn their phones off
before class.

26:09.359 --> 26:10.277
Can you drive faster?

26:11.152 --> 26:12.112
Okay.

26:14.030 --> 26:15.115
Now,

26:16.241 --> 26:18.285
listen to me. You scared?

26:21.705 --> 26:24.708
Don't be a bitch! Stand up straight
and let me test this out.

26:26.501 --> 26:29.170
Don't shoot. Don't shoot that gun.

26:29.254 --> 26:31.756
Hold him right there, please.

26:33.925 --> 26:35.135
Don't shoot, please!

26:36.553 --> 26:37.387
Stay still.

26:38.263 --> 26:39.139
No, don't!

26:39.973 --> 26:41.182
GRADE 2 CLASS 1 ADDRESS BOOK

26:41.266 --> 26:42.892
"8-1-5-5…"

26:42.976 --> 26:44.060
NO RESULTS FOUND

26:48.315 --> 26:49.858
Run for the exit!

26:54.029 --> 26:55.030
What was that?

26:56.364 --> 26:57.949
I didn't even pull the trigger.

27:05.665 --> 27:07.959
This asshole loaded it with steel pellets.

27:08.043 --> 27:09.210
Are you crazy?!

27:09.294 --> 27:11.129
Were you trying to fucking kill us?

27:12.130 --> 27:13.965
Yeah, that's right, fuckers! I'm crazy!

27:14.049 --> 27:15.383
Hold him.

27:15.884 --> 27:18.053
Okay, I've had enough of your shit,
fucking asshole.

27:20.388 --> 27:22.641
Oh, found it.

27:24.184 --> 27:25.226
Yeong-dong?

27:30.940 --> 27:33.276
I asked as nicely as I could.

27:45.622 --> 27:46.956
Where you going?

27:48.833 --> 27:51.711
Yeong-dong, please! I'm sorry, okay?

27:51.795 --> 27:52.629
I'm so sorry!

27:52.712 --> 27:54.339
What I did was wrong.

27:55.674 --> 27:57.258
Don't apologize to me.

27:57.342 --> 27:59.719
- I'm so sorry.
- I don't believe you.

27:59.803 --> 28:02.514
Oh my God! No, no!

28:03.431 --> 28:04.974
Mom! Mama!

28:20.782 --> 28:23.284
Get somewhere safe! Go, go!

28:26.204 --> 28:27.580
He's crazy!

28:27.664 --> 28:29.499
Get inside! Get inside!

28:29.582 --> 28:31.126
Holy crap!

28:31.209 --> 28:34.838
- What the hell is happening?
- Out of my way! Move! Let me get out!

28:37.882 --> 28:39.551
Get out! Come on!

28:39.634 --> 28:40.927
Hey, don't push so hard!

28:41.010 --> 28:42.262
I said, don't push!

28:42.345 --> 28:43.555
Stop blocking the door!

28:43.638 --> 28:45.056
Get out!

28:45.140 --> 28:46.266
Why are you--

28:50.687 --> 28:52.522
- Move!
- Oh.

28:54.649 --> 28:55.984
You alright, Gyu-jin?

29:06.327 --> 29:07.579
It's okay.

29:09.456 --> 29:10.582
They can't get out.

29:20.091 --> 29:20.925
You…

29:22.260 --> 29:23.428
you locked them in here?

29:24.804 --> 29:25.972
Mm.

29:26.681 --> 29:27.640
Go ahead.

29:30.643 --> 29:31.811
Let's get revenge.

29:38.318 --> 29:39.319
Time

29:39.861 --> 29:41.696
to kill the whole school.

29:58.505 --> 30:00.548
Move! Move, motherfuckers!

30:01.508 --> 30:03.760
Get out of the way! And stop panicking!

30:03.843 --> 30:05.178
- Oh fuck!
- Away!

30:05.678 --> 30:06.596
Push, man!

30:11.935 --> 30:13.812
Help us!

30:25.824 --> 30:27.408
This way! Get out of the way!

30:37.085 --> 30:39.170
Over here! Help us!

30:39.754 --> 30:42.090
- Please open the doors!
- Help us!

30:42.173 --> 30:43.925
- Please help us!
- Over here!

30:51.850 --> 30:53.560
A FUTURE SOCIETY BUILT ON GOOD CHARACTER

31:03.945 --> 31:05.446
Open the door!

31:05.530 --> 31:07.115
This one's locked too!

31:07.198 --> 31:08.408
You have to step back!

31:08.491 --> 31:10.285
Step back! Back up!

31:23.631 --> 31:25.008
Out of the way!

31:27.719 --> 31:29.262
Everyone out! Come on!

31:29.345 --> 31:30.722
- Go! Go!
- Hurry, get out!

31:30.805 --> 31:31.890
Go!

31:31.973 --> 31:33.808
- Go, go!
- Careful!

31:34.559 --> 31:36.060
Huh? Officer Lee!

31:50.533 --> 31:51.618
Run! Run!

31:59.792 --> 32:01.044
Go! Quiet!

32:01.127 --> 32:02.629
This way! Quickly! Quickly!

32:03.713 --> 32:05.048
Hide! Quickly!

32:05.882 --> 32:07.467
Hurry up and close the door!

32:07.550 --> 32:09.177
Everyone find a place to hide!

32:09.260 --> 32:11.054
Quick, quick, bring the desks over!

32:11.137 --> 32:12.639
Stop pushing! Close the doors!

32:21.481 --> 32:24.442
- Get in here already!
- Where's the shooter?!

32:25.443 --> 32:27.278
- Come on, hurry!
- Move the desks!

32:27.362 --> 32:28.905
Create a barricade! Go, go!

32:29.906 --> 32:31.115
You have to push!

32:37.038 --> 32:38.081
Push!

32:43.920 --> 32:45.672
Run! Get over here!

32:45.755 --> 32:47.256
Hide! Quickly!

32:49.676 --> 32:50.927
Here! Get down!

33:01.896 --> 33:02.772
Oh!

33:09.946 --> 33:12.448
Oh fucking shit! Quiet down.

33:21.374 --> 33:22.500
Seong-jun.

33:25.336 --> 33:27.255
I know you're in here, so come out.

33:33.720 --> 33:35.930
Seong-jun, I know you're in here!

33:36.723 --> 33:38.891
So come on out before I kill you all!

33:44.105 --> 33:45.898
When did he get so crazy?

33:47.525 --> 33:50.653
If you come out now,
I'll allow everyone else out of here.

33:55.366 --> 33:57.368
It's time to pay for what you did.

33:59.454 --> 34:01.122
Keep your fucking mouths shut!

34:02.832 --> 34:04.000
Yeong-dong, wait!

34:07.628 --> 34:09.005
Yeong-dong, it's me.

34:09.839 --> 34:11.799
How about we talk about this for a moment?

34:12.550 --> 34:14.927
- There's nothing to say.
- What?

34:16.471 --> 34:17.388
Sir…

34:18.848 --> 34:21.768
…I… came to your office.

34:23.603 --> 34:25.313
I said I was having…

34:26.647 --> 34:27.774
…a hard time.

34:29.108 --> 34:31.778
- You said that you would help.
- Right. Right, I remember.

34:32.779 --> 34:33.905
I tried to listen.

34:34.822 --> 34:38.284
I promise I'll take care of you
from now on. Please, put the gun down.

34:39.327 --> 34:42.038
You don't have to… go out this way, okay?

34:42.872 --> 34:44.248
You said you knew me.

34:47.376 --> 34:48.753
But I'm just a loser

34:49.962 --> 34:53.049
who gets stuff stolen
and beaten up every day.

34:53.132 --> 34:56.010
I know the pain you're going through.
I'm on your side.

34:56.761 --> 34:58.888
- Please, just calm down!
- Shut the fuck up!

34:58.971 --> 35:02.100
You never did anything for me!
So just shut up!

35:02.183 --> 35:05.019
Yeong-dong!

35:05.103 --> 35:06.896
He's over here! Yu-seok is here!

35:06.979 --> 35:07.980
Why would you say that?

35:08.064 --> 35:10.900
He said he wouldn't kill us
if we let him know where you are!

35:10.983 --> 35:12.026
Shut your mouth!

35:13.945 --> 35:15.154
Come out!

35:16.447 --> 35:18.950
Yu-seok! Stop hiding!

35:49.605 --> 35:50.439
Holy shit!

36:02.910 --> 36:04.745
- Let's get outta here!
- Come on!

36:05.246 --> 36:07.081
- Make sure the kids are safe.
- Okay!

36:07.665 --> 36:08.916
You go! I'm good.

36:12.003 --> 36:13.838
Seong-jun, stop hiding!

36:40.698 --> 36:41.741
Seong-jun.

37:07.725 --> 37:08.809
Everyone okay?

37:08.893 --> 37:10.394
I'm with the police.

37:12.021 --> 37:13.231
You kids okay?

37:13.940 --> 37:14.774
You're not hurt?

37:14.857 --> 37:16.150
- Yeah.
- No.

37:16.734 --> 37:20.071
- We… we seem to be fine.
- That's a relief.

37:20.154 --> 37:20.988
Yeah.
